{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1064849/block/singleImage/3273300/wm/01M26VV4ZFRQ4W5DT15XRZ71QP.jpg?updatedAt=1795151193\"/><figcaption>淺水灣泳灘女子疑仰藥輕生，救生員發現昏迷送院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (20 日 ) 上午 8 時許，一名女子昏迷在淺水灣一號泳灘上，救生員聞訊趕到，發現她尚有呼吸脈搏，遂帶到救護站進行急救，隨後由救護車送往律敦治醫院搶救。據悉，女事主曾服用大量藥物，不排除仰藥自殺。警方正調查事主身份及事件經過，案件列作「有人暈倒」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.342685+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:06:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:14.388101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:19.120100+00:00","content_hash":"13ca35a528f9729fc9b70aec22bb3b9a2e4189b8331867700d32c9849d35c7b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.342685+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}